### Minecraft Modding ###
run/
!**/src/**/run/
**/src/generated/**/.cache/
repo/
!**/src/**/repo/

# build/run logs written by the dev shell (any loader, any round)
.gradle-*.log

# Third-party *nested* jars that used to be committed under neoforge/libs/.
# They are Sable's companion jar and Create's ponder (catnip) jar, taken out of the corresponding
# mod jars. They are redistributions of someone else's code, so they are not part of this
# repository any more: `gradlew` extracts them from the locally installed mods instead
# (`physicsModsDir` in neoforge/gradle.properties, default D:/MC mod/红石电路/模组). Anything left
# here by hand is ignored; neoforge/libs/README.md explains where they come from.
neoforge/libs/*.jar
libs/*.jar


# dev-run client/server logs
logs/

# release output: the jars that get uploaded to Modrinth / CurseForge.
# They are built from build/libs, so there is no reason to commit them.
dist/

# Internal development records: the rounds' diagnostic logs, the port TODO and the publishing
# notes. They record how each defect was found, in Chinese, for the author - useful locally,
# not part of the public repository, so they live in the 红石电路 folder next to the jars and
# are ignored here so a stray copy cannot be committed back by accident.
交付说明-*.md
上架材料-*.md
开发记录/
COMPAT-*.md
PORT-TODO.md


# scratch file the delegated build rounds write their commit message into
build_msg.tmp
build/_msg.tmp


# dev GameTest run directory (a world, an eula and per-run configs are not source)
run-gametest/
**/run-gametest/
